    "biography": "<p><strong>Type:</strong> Smart Animal</p><p><strong>Niche:</strong> Titan</p><p><strong>Numbers:</strong> 1 Swarm Unit</p><p>A Titan Tech prank that got out of hand, these bands of ten-centimeter-tall poisonous primates were thought to have been eradicated, but it’s always possible some got away.</p><p><strong>Ware:</strong> Poison Gland (BTX), Prehensile Feet, Prehensile Tail</p><p><strong>Swarm:</strong> Use the rules given for Swarms (p. 168). Stats given are for one swarm, not individual marmosets.</p><p><em>Initiative printed: 5 (X-Risks uses (INT + REF) ÷ 5); Wound Threshold 0, Death Rating 60.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase X-Risks, p. 163.</em></p>",
